## sdk.dir is machine-specific and usually auto-generated by Android Studio.
## Copy useful keys below into local.properties (do not commit real secrets).

## Backend API base URL (must end with /api/)
# API_BASE_URL=https://smartbus-w5qy.onrender.com/api/

## Stadia Maps raster tiles (keep the real key only in local.properties; do not commit it).
# STADIA_MAPS_API_KEY=your-stadia-api-key
